# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Call Center Staffing — environment reference
#
# NOTE: The site currently works WITHOUT any of these set because the production
# public values have source fallbacks. Prefer setting analytics values in hosting
# so changes do not require code edits.
#
# The only real SECRET (reCAPTCHA secret key) is NOT here — it is configured in
# the SplitForms dashboard, never in the app or repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

